      "updated": 1757139955482,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "URL shortner\n\nRequirements\n- Given a url, system should return a short url for it\n- User can provide custom alias for its original url\n- Users can provide optional expiry for their urls\n- Given a short url, system should return its original url\n- Short url generated must be unique\n- Support different algorithms to generate short urls\n- Track analytics (Click count for short url)\n- notify user on url expiry",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "URL shortner\n\nRequirements\n- Given a url, system should return a short url for it\n- User can provide custom alias for its original url\n- Users can provide optional expiry for their urls\n- Given a short url, system should return its original url\n- Short url generated must be unique\n- Support different algorithms to generate short urls\n- Track analytics (Click count for short url)\n- notify user on url expiry",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
